Output av-trace.mp4

Set Timeout 30s
Set Shell "env PS1='vault@control:~$ ' bash --norc"
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "av trace 'curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/main/scripts/install.sh | bash'"
Enter

Wait

Sleep 2
